      "message": "This seems potentially brittle and tedious towards external changes. Could you do something similar here like in bp2buildDefaultConfig, and use a toggle between recursively allowing everything below it vs just that directory? That would shorten this list to:\n\nNon-recursive:\n.\nprebuilts/clang/host/linux-x86\nprebuilts/sdk\nprebuilts/sdk/tools\n\nRecursive:\nbuild/bazel\nbuild/pesto\nexternal/bazelbuild-rules_android\n\nAre there cases where that wouldn\u0027t be feasible?",
