      "writtenOn": "2021-05-17T05:33:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What I meant was that if there\u0027s any upstream change to build/bazel, build/pesto or any of the external/* repos, we\u0027ll need to update this list right?\n\nCan we do a simple prefix matching instead?",
      "parentUuid": "8b042800_6438f7cb",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 136,
        "startChar": 3,
